<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Renaissance Art History</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A short journey through the history of Renaissance art: its origins, its great masters and its lasting legacy.">
  <style>
    :root {
      --parchment: #f4ead5;
      --parchment-dark: #e8d9b5;
      --ink: #2b1d12;
      --ink-soft: #5a4632;
      --gold: #b8862b;
      --gold-light: #d9b35c;
      --crimson: #7a1f1f;
      --lapis: #1f3a68;
      --shadow: rgba(43, 29, 18, 0.18);
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: "Palatino Linotype", Palatino, "Book Antiqua", Georgia, serif;
      background: var(--parchment);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.7;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(184, 134, 43, 0.08), transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 90%, rgba(122, 31, 31, 0.06), transparent 40%);
    }

    /* ---------- Navigation ---------- */
    nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      background: var(--ink);
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--gold);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px var(--shadow);
    }

    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .logo {
      color: var(--gold-light);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 6px; list-style: none; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--parchment);
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      border-color: var(--gold);
      color: var(--gold-light);
    }

